 <section class="reading-section" id="updates"><h2>${i("结果更新与解读","Result updates and interpretation")}</h2><p>${i("新结果通过核验后更新对应模型与思考档位。未参与、失败或未完成的评测继续保留已有有效成绩。不同评分版本的历史记录保留各自来源，缺少子轴明细时不作推算补齐。","Verified results update the corresponding model and reasoning effort. Existing valid scores remain in place when a new run is absent, failed, or incomplete. Historical scoring versions retain their provenance, and missing subscores are never inferred.")}</p><p>${i("分差反映本次评测任务范围内的表现。选型时请优先查看与你工作相关的能力维度，再结合自有任务验证。","Score deltas reflect performance within the evaluated task scope. Start with the capability dimensions closest to your work, then validate candidates on your own tasks.")}</p></section>
